{"id": "37141", "title": "威猛先生", "author": "路可可", "category": "文学名著", "count": 21, "available": 12, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/37/37141.htm", "intro": "他尤威猛真是人如其名，长得真够高大威猛了，\r\n熟女看了都想流口水，可惜他对欲女没兴趣，\r\n偏爱小家碧玉型的清秀佳人，像龚小青就很合他的口味，\r\n不过一夜之后他发现她的个跟“清秀佳人”不同路，\r\n不仅完全不“小家碧玉”，还大剌剌的、大嗓门……\r\n天啊，这样粗线条的女人，他昨晚竟还觉得她楚楚可怜，\r\n听到她早早名花有主被人下订时，还乱心痛一把的……\r\n这女人真是夜晚比白天美丽，病著比没病更像个女人。\r\n要不是干妈把生病的她丢给他照顾，哪见得到她的真面目。\r\n然而就在他将她打“×”后，慢慢地又发现了她的可爱……", "base": "files/article/html/37/37141", "chapters": [{"title": "第1章(1)", "file": "2913137.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1章(2)", "file": "2913138.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2章(1)", "file": "2913139.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2章(2", "file": "2913140.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3章(1)", "file": "2913141.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3章(2)", "file": "2913142.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4章(1)", "file": "2913143.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4章(2", "file": "2913144.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5章(1)", "file": "2913145.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5章(2)", "file": "2913146.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第6章(1)", "file": "2913147.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第6章(2)", "file": "2913148.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第7章(1)", "file": "2913149.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第7章(2)", "file": "2913150.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第8章(1", "file": "2913151.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第8章(2", "file": "2913152.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第9章(1)", "file": "2913153.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第9章(2)  。", "file": "2913154.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第10章(1)", "file": "2913155.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第10章(2)", "file": "2913156.html", "available": true}, {"title": "尾声", "file": "2913157.html", "available": true}]}